==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Some tanky meatshields (preferably [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist/Ramen Cat]] aided by Research [[Cat Combo]]) and a few DPS units are all that is needed to clear this stage. Alternatively, [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can safely solo the {{1c}} and {{2c}} versions within the time range necessary to earn all of the rewards. In {{3c}}, you'll need to use meatshields or an Attack UP combo alongside him, such as [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] and [[Brave Cutter (Combo)|Brave Cutter]].

